    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "You start with:"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "lot",
      "label": "the round begins",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(round - 1) - 3 * int((round - 1) / 3) + 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "current_lot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "lots[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "lots",
            "value": {
              "calc": "current_lot"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "keep_options",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[current_lot[0] + current_lot[1], current_lot[3] + current_lot[4]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "auction_recipient",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} of {rounds} begins. Seat {active_seat} is the seller; the other two seats are the bidders."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "lot",
      "label": "keep a card",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "keep_options"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "kept"
      },
      "text": "You are the seller this round. The two options are the two cards of your secret lot, which nobody else sees. Choose the card to keep: its value is added secretly to your holding in its colour. The other card is announced to everyone and auctioned to the two bidders."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "lot",
      "label": "the kept card",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "kept_card",
            "value": "$kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "auction_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "keep_options[1] if kept_card == keep_options[0] else keep_options[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(kept_card[1])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "kept_card[0] == 'R'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(kept_card[1])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "kept_card[0] == 'B'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(kept_card[1])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "kept_card[0] == 'G'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "auction_colour",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'Red' if auction_card[0] == 'R' else ('Blue' if auction_card[0] == 'B' else 'Green')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "auction_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(auction_card[1])"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "auction",
      "label": "the auction card",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Round {round}: seat {active_seat} auctions {auction_colour} {auction_value}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "talk",
      "label": "talk",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 30
      },
      "store": "message",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} says: {value}"
      },
      "text": "Write one short message to the table. Everyone writes at the same time and all messages are then shown to everyone. Messages are not binding and may be false."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "bid",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "min_bid"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.gold"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} bids {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are a bidder for the auction card ({auction_value} of the announced colour). Submit a sealed whole-number bid from {min_bid} up to your gold. If your bid is strictly higher, you pay it to the seller and take the card, then may shift one colour's worth. If the bids are equal (including both 0), nobody pays and the seller takes the card."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "resolve the auction",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid for p in players if p.seat != active_seat])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.seat for p in players if p.seat != active_seat and p.bid == high_bid]) if count(p.seat != active_seat and p.bid == high_bid for p in players) == 1 else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "gold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-high_bid"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "gold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "high_bid"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "auction_recipient",
            "value": {
              "calc": "winner_seat if winner_seat > 0 else active_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auction_recipient"
            },
            "key": "red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "auction_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "auction_colour == 'Red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auction_recipient"
            },
            "key": "blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "auction_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "auction_colour == 'Blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auction_recipient"
            },
            "key": "green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "auction_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "auction_colour == 'Green'"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Highest bid: {high_bid}. Winning bidder: seat {winner_seat} (0 means the bids tied: nobody pays and the seller keeps the auction card)."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "shift",
      "label": "shift worth",
      "when": {
        "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "no change",
          "Red +1",
          "Red -1",
          "Blue +1",
          "Blue -1",
          "Green +1",
          "Green -1"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "shift"
      },
      "text": "You won the auction. You may raise or lower one colour's worth by {worth_shift}, or change nothing. Worths stay between {worth_min} and {worth_max}: a change past these limits has no effect. Current worths: Red {worth_red}, Blue {worth_blue}, Green {worth_green}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "shift",
      "label": "apply the shift",
      "when": {
        "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "worth_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "worth_shift"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "$shift == 'Red +1' and worth_red + worth_shift <= worth_max"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "worth_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-worth_shift"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "$shift == 'Red -1' and worth_red - worth_shift >= worth_min"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "worth_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "worth_shift"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "$shift == 'Blue +1' and worth_blue + worth_shift <= worth_max"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "worth_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-worth_shift"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "$shift == 'Blue -1' and worth_blue - worth_shift >= worth_min"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "worth_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "worth_shift"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "$shift == 'Green +1' and worth_green + worth_shift <= worth_max"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "worth_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-worth_shift"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "$shift == 'Green -1' and worth_green - worth_shift >= worth_min"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {winner_seat} chose: {shift}."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "shift",
      "label": "the worths",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Seat {auction_recipient} received the auction card. Worths: Red {worth_red}, Blue {worth_blue}, Green {worth_green}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end of round",
      "label": "next round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "final scoring",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round > rounds"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "vp",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((0 if max([p.red for p in players]) == 0 else (worth_red if count(p.red == max([q.red for q in players]) for p in players) == 1 else int(worth_red / tie_share_divisor))) if you.red == max([p.red for p in players]) else 0) + ((0 if max([p.blue for p in players]) == 0 else (worth_blue if count(p.blue == max([q.blue for q in players]) for p in players) == 1 else int(worth_blue / tie_share_divisor))) if you.blue == max([p.blue for p in players]) else 0) + ((0 if max([p.green for p in players]) == 0 else (worth_green if count(p.green == max([q.green for q in players]) for p in players) == 1 else int(worth_green / tie_share_divisor))) if you.green == max([p.green for p in players]) else 0) + int(you.gold / gold_per_vp)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The last round is over. Final worths: Red {worth_red}, Blue {worth_blue}, Green {worth_green}. Victory points are counted."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round > rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round > rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.vp * 1000 + you.gold",
      "reveal": [
        "red",
        "blue",
        "green"
      ],
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final VP (gold): Seat 1 {players[0].vp} ({players[0].gold}), Seat 2 {players[1].vp} ({players[1].gold}), Seat 3 {players[2].vp} ({players[2].gold})."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 12,
    "rounds_max": 12,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Three players, seated 1, 2 and 3. Each player starts with {start_gold} gold and a holding of {start_holding} in each of three colours: Red, Blue and Green. Gold is public. A player always knows their own holdings; other players' holdings are never shown during the game. Each colour has a public worth, starting at {start_worth}.\n\nTHE LOT LIST. There are exactly {lot_count} lots of {cards_per_lot} cards each: R1+B4, R2+B3, B1+R4, B2+R3, R1+G4, R2+G3, G1+R4, G2+R3, B1+G4, B2+G3, G1+B4, G2+B3. R1 means a Red card of value 1, B4 a Blue card of value 4, and so on. Every lot sums to {lot_sum}. Every individual card appears in exactly {lots_per_card} lots. Before round 1, the lots are put in a random hidden order. Round k uses the k-th lot, so all {lot_count} lots are used, one per round.\n\nROUNDS. There are {rounds} rounds. The active player (seller) is seat 1 in round 1, seat 2 in round 2, seat 3 in round 3, seat 1 in round 4, and so on: in round k it is seat ((k-1) mod 3) + 1, so each seat is active {active_turns_per_seat} times. The two other players are the bidders.\n\nEACH ROUND:\n1. Private view. This round's lot is shown to the active player only. No other player ever sees it.\n2. Keep. The active player chooses one of the two cards to keep. Its value is added secretly to that player's holding in its colour (e.g. keeping G3 adds 3 to Green).\n3. Announce. The other card (the auction card) is announced to everyone: its colour and value. Others can deduce the kept card's value ({lot_sum} minus the auction value), but its colour is one of the two lots containing the auction card. Lots already used narrow this down.\n4. Talk. All three players each write one short message at the same time, without seeing the others. All messages are then shown to everyone. Messages are not binding and may be false.\n5. Bid. The two bidders, at the same time, each submit a whole-number bid from {min_bid} up to the gold they hold.\n6. Resolve. Both bids are announced. If one bid is strictly higher, that bidder wins: the winner pays the bid to the active player (gold moves from winner to active player) and adds the auction card's value to their holding in its colour. If the bids are equal (including both 0), nobody pays: the active player adds the auction card's value to their own holding in its colour. The log records who received the auction card.\n7. Shift worth. If a bidder won, that winner may choose one colour and raise its worth by {worth_shift} or lower it by {worth_shift}, or change nothing. Worth stays between {worth_min} and {worth_max}: a change past these limits has no effect (e.g. Red at 5 with Red +1 stays 5). If nobody won, no shift happens. The worths are announced.\n\nEND OF GAME (after round {rounds}). For each colour, compare the three players' holdings. The single highest holder scores VP equal to that colour's final worth. If two or three players tie for highest, each tied player scores half the worth, rounded down (worth divided by {tie_share_divisor}). If everyone holds 0 in a colour, nobody scores that colour. Each player also scores 1 VP for every full {gold_per_vp} gold they hold (gold divided by {gold_per_vp}, rounded down). A player's VP is the colour VP plus the gold VP.\n\nThe player with the most VP wins. If players tie on VP, the tied player with more remaining gold wins. Players still tied share the win (a draw between them)."
}
